1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,610
You're taller in the morning.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:05,809
Between the bones of your spine are soft discs, full of water.

3
00:00:06,309 --> 00:00:10,739
Standing all day squeezes water out, and you lose a centimetre or two.

4
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:14,120
Lying down at night, the discs soak it back up.

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:18,247
Astronauts in orbit stretch even more, up to 3 %.

6
00:00:18,747 --> 00:00:20,610
Measure your height before breakfast.
